	你借着洞口钟乳石的阴影打开防潮火绒匣，将暗匣底层的旧银币与古物稳妥收入包中。<span class="green">你在海滩洞穴顺利起出了防潮火绒匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[拍净衣角回街 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	防潮火绒匣被钟乳石钙化层咬住了底边，你硬掰时指尖蹭在尖锐石棱上，生疼发麻。<span class="red">指尖被钟乳石棱刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World BeachCave StalactiteTinderbox]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖回街口 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[摸出火绒匣 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸出火绒匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "借树影抽盒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-beachcave-stalactitetinderbox">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_beachcave_stalactitetinderbox_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你顺着钙化槽位轻轻旋开卡簧，将防潮火绒匣连同夹层里的零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的防潮火绒匣。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着街巷回街口 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	洞顶钟乳石滴下的冰凉水珠落在手背上，冻得你指尖一缩。<span class="red">手头失了准头，你只好先退到干燥的岩壁旁。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准支点重新撬动 (0:04)|MP World BeachCave StalactiteTinderbox]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[整好衣领回街口 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[借树影抽盒 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "借树影抽盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Forest CypressRootTin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Forest")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Forest">>
<</if>>
深林古柏树根交错形成的天然石洞里藏着一只猎人留下的锡皮罐。<<mpAmbient>>你垂眸细看树根缝隙，发现锡皮罐盖沿刻着指北箭头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林小径 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="wev-mp-world-forest-cypressroottin">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "撬开锡皮罐 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-forest-cypressroottin">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_forest_cypressroottin")>><<money 220>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	你借着古柏盘根的掩护撬开猎人锡皮罐，把里头留存的旧银币与古物收进暗袋。<span class="green">你在深林古柏下顺利起出了猎人锡皮罐。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回原处 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锡皮罐被盘根错节的古柏树根箍得很紧，你伸手去掏时手背被粗糙树皮擦出一道红痕。<span class="red">手背被古柏硬根刮痛，只得先缩回手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP World Forest CypressRootTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回森林小径 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撬开锡皮罐 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开锡皮罐">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "衣袖挡视线取下 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#wev-mp-world-forest-cypressroottin">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_forest_cypressroottin_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>
	你捏住罐沿顺着树根空隙斜向旋出，将锡皮罐连同里面的干草药与零钞一并取下。<span class="green">你用巧劲取下了完好无损的猎人锡皮罐。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回外围通道 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	树洞里的陈年松针与腐叶灰呛得你鼻尖发痒，手上的动作随之慢了半拍。<span class="red">你掩住口鼻退开半步，暂缓了探手动作。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP World Forest CypressRootTin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回前厅 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[衣袖挡视线取下 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "衣袖挡视线取下">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


